Commands Cheat-Sheet
Task	Command
Add readiness probe via CLI	oc set probe deployment/<name> --readiness --get-url=http://:8080/healthz --period-seconds=10 --failure-threshold=6
Add liveness probe via CLI	oc set probe deployment/<name> --liveness --get-url=http://:8080/healthz --period-seconds=10 --failure-threshold=6
Edit deployment YAML	oc edit deployment <name>
Apply updated YAML	oc apply -f deployment.yaml

